  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Second release of Blimmo.SemanticVersion, a semantic versioning library for .NET.\n\t\t\tChanges in this release include:\n\t\t\t- Changed format specifiers for formatting versions to be more intuitive. Specifically:\n\t\t\t- F  => Major.Minor.Patch[-Prerelease][+Build]\n\t\t\t- VVVV => Major.Minor[-Prerelease]\n\t\t\t- VVV => Major[.Minor][-Prerelease]\n\t\t\t- VV => Major.Minor\n\t\t\t- M[n] => Major (padded with n zeroes)\n\t\t\t- m[n] => Minor (padded with n zeroes)\n\t\t\t- mo[n] => [Minor] (padded with n zeroes)\n\t\t\t- md[n] => [.] (. if Minor is present, otherwise empty)\n\t\t\t- p[n] => Patch (padded with n zeroes)\n\t\t\t- po[n] => [Patch] (padded with n zeroes)\n\t\t\t- pd => [.] (. if Patch is present, otherwise empty)\n\t\t\t- pr => [Prerelease]\n\t\t\t- prh => [-] (- if Prerelease is present, otherwise empty)\n\t\t\t- b => [Build]\n\t\t\t- bp => [+] (+ if Build is present, otherwise empty)",
